# T114: a failing second app stops the run: the summary says what was updated, what failed and what was not tried.
# scenario updates
# server broken app-02
size 1404 1872
wait 400
tap refresh
waitfor catalogLine Catalog last updated
tap menu
tap menuUpdateAll
waitfor planSummary Update App app-01
tap consent 0
tap consent 1
tap confirm
waitfor resultText Updated: App app-01
expect resultText Failed: App app-02
expect resultText Not tried: App app-03, App pbstore
expect resultReader not changed
shot @OUT@/33-update-all-stopped.png
tap ok
waitfor appRow
quit
